            "review_title": "Review at Busan Korean Food - Mon Han Quoc",
            "review_text": "JohnnyCarragher\nPerth, Australia34 contributions\n0\nMost authentic tasting Korean food outside of Korea\nMar 2024 • Solo\nWe ordered the Jjajangmyeon (Black bean noodles), Kimchi Soup and the Miyeok Guk (Seaweed soup) \n\nI have spent multiple long times in South Korea and am in love with Korean food, so I am so surprised by the food from this restaurant, it brought me back in time it felt I was in Korea indulging on the same foods listed above but only in vietnam. \n\nIf you’re Korean and are travelling or visiting Saigon please go here, the only thing I wish they had was Soondae and pickled radish. \n\nOther than that it blew my mind away! 😊😊\nRead more\nWritten March 13, 2024",
